  subgraph PROB["① THE PROBLEM — 4 systemic failure points"]
    direction TB
    PB1["🗂️ Paper-bound statutory registers<br/>Form IV / Form V + daily logbooks<br/>tampering, back-dating, loss"]
    PB2["🚫 Zero underground connectivity<br/>sirdar / inspector cannot log a<br/>live hazard from the coal face"]
    PB3["🕶️ Black-box safety decisions<br/>unexplainable ML wins zero trust<br/>from statutory officers"]
    PB4["🌊 Inrush and gas latency<br/>lab hydro-titration needs 24-48 h<br/>but a mine can flood in 15 min"]
  end

  %% ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  %% 2. TIER 1 — OFFLINE-FIRST CAPTURE  (works with no signal)
  %% ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  subgraph CAP["② WHAT WE USE · TIER 1 — OFFLINE-FIRST CAPTURE"]
    direction TB
    PWA["📱 React 19 + Vite 8 PWA<br/>installable, runs inside the pit<br/>vite-plugin-pwa + Workbox"]
    IDB["💾 IndexedDB zero-data-loss buffer<br/>Dexie CoalGuardOfflineDB + idb<br/>voice / photo / form payloads"]
    GPSN["📍 GPS proof-of-presence<br/>+ per-mine geofence radius_m"]
    LANS["🖧 Store-and-forward sync<br/>flushes on LAN / WiFi heartbeat<br/>with retry_count backoff"]
  end

  %% ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  %% 3. TIER 2 — SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH  (Supabase cloud)
  %% ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  subgraph DATA["③ WHAT WE USE · TIER 2 — SUPABASE SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH"]
    direction TB
    AUTH["🔐 Auth + RBAC<br/>enum user_role:<br/>mine_official | corporate | regulator"]
    PG["🗄️ PostgreSQL 16 schema<br/>mines · violations · inspections<br/>compliance_items · alerts · risk_scores<br/>contractors · contractor_incidents · users"]
    PPEV["👁️ PPE vision tables<br/>ppe_cameras · ppe_events<br/>per-zone compliance %"]
    SREG["📑 statutory_registers<br/>CMR-2017 shift log<br/>with hash + prev_hash"]
    LED["🔒 audit_ledger hash chain<br/>SHA-256 of record + prev_hash<br/>= tamper-evident proof"]
    RTW["📡 Realtime WebSockets<br/>push new hazards to every cockpit"]
    BUCK["🖼️ Storage bucket: photos<br/>violation + PPE snapshot evidence"]
    TICK["🎫 support_tickets<br/>grievance to resolution trail"]
  end

